<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 14.71 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 14.71 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 14.71 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 264 7.00% (1999)	 zero</p>
<p> code 285 5.00% (2001)	 3.04</p>
<p> code 251 9.00% (2003)	 3.90</p>
<p> code 273 6.50% (2005)	 4.32</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% (2007)	 3.45</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 14.76 bln bfr of OLO 248 9.25% 1998.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
